{
 "_readme": "What ships from the lineless Midjourney art (brand-voice-research, branch mj-hunt-0915, lineless/). Files are relative to that lineless/ dir. Run `python3 tools/art/cut-lineless.py <lineless-dir>` after editing. heroes = the 21 egg-hatch characters (the timer's surprise); packs = goal-ladder themes, each with members, one boss and the pack egg; timerIcons = the reminder sheet; backgrounds = 15 square scenes, `earnedBy` names the theme that unlocks it, the rest are free. taskIcons = the 42 job-tile icons (src/task-icons.ts ids, picked 2026-09-17), cut to public/assets/icons/<id>.png; `--only taskicons`. faceIcons = the faces that are not job tiles (routine headers, the goal, practice-step and savings defaults), same cut, same folder, never in the picker; `--only faceicons`. storeArt = the five Treasure Box tiles src/store-art.ts names, cut to public/assets/store/<slug>.png at 512; `--only storeart`.",
